cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these results or the harness, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "rust-build-bench: a reproducible benchmark of Rust monorepo build and test tools"
abstract: >-
  Replays real merged commits of large Rust workspaces through Cargo, sccache,
  cargo-rail, moon, Bazel and Buck2, measures pull-request CI time on fresh and
  warm runners, and checks with a planted upstream change that no tool reports
  a stale test result.
authors:
  - family-names: Esperanza
    given-names: Jonathan
repository-code: "https://github.com/jesperanzasolo/rust-build-bench"
license:
